    {
      "subId": "7351201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Vinayak",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735120101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735120101": {
            "id": "735120101",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Oh... thank you, brave Traveler!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120102"
            ]
          },
          "735120102": {
            "id": "735120102",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Oh, phew! It hasn't been too long and the parts are still in good condition... Just a few more adjustments...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120103"
            ]
          },
          "735120103": {
            "id": "735120103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Vinayak starts tinkering with the machinery...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120104"
            ]
          },
          "735120104": {
            "id": "735120104",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "...Vinayak?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120105"
            ]
          },
          "735120105": {
            "id": "735120105",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Almost done... I'm almost done!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120106"
            ]
          },
          "735120106": {
            "id": "735120106",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "Vi-na-yak!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120107"
            ]
          },
          "735120107": {
            "id": "735120107",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Whoa! Shriya? When did you get here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120108"
            ]
          },
          "735120108": {
            "id": "735120108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "When you were fiddling with the components...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120109"
            ]
          },
          "735120109": {
            "id": "735120109",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Didn't you say that this place was dangerous and full of monsters? Why are you even here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120110"
            ]
          },
          "735120110": {
            "id": "735120110",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "...I'm just worried about our components. If we can't finish this assignment, even I can't return to the Akademiya!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120111"
            ]
          },
          "735120111": {
            "id": "735120111",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Ha, I knew it. Look, I have everything here. Once we go back and make some more adjustments, we can finally start assembling.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120112"
            ]
          },
          "735120112": {
            "id": "735120112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, what are all these components for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120113"
            ]
          },
          "735120113": {
            "id": "735120113",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Ah, I forgot to tell you. They're for the Wenutslayer Cannon, our graduation project.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120114"
            ]
          },
          "735120114": {
            "id": "735120114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why such an obscure topic?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120115"
            ]
          },
          "735120115": {
            "id": "735120115",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "If you'd applied for graduation, you'd understand why... Well, not that any of this matters now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120116"
            ]
          },
          "735120116": {
            "id": "735120116",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "Allow me to formally introduce myself. I am Shriya, an Amurta graduate with a specialization in desert biology and ecology.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120117"
            ]
          },
          "735120117": {
            "id": "735120117",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "This machine-obsessed doofus over here is a Kshahrewar researcher with a specialization in applied mechanics.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120118"
            ]
          },
          "735120118": {
            "id": "735120118",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "...I'm Vinayak. Thanks a lot for earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120119"
            ]
          },
          "735120119": {
            "id": "735120119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Can people with completely different fields of study... work together?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120120"
            ]
          },
          "735120120": {
            "id": "735120120",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "Don't get me started... Working with him on our graduation proposal was definitely the biggest mistake I've ever made as a student...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120121"
            ]
          },
          "735120121": {
            "id": "735120121",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "You can't really say that. We both managed to graduate in the end anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120122"
            ]
          },
          "735120122": {
            "id": "735120122",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "We did, yes, but did you forget how many extra years it took?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120123"
            ]
          },
          "735120123": {
            "id": "735120123",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Whatever the case, we graduated, right? I heard some of our classmates just completed their thesis proposal last year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120124"
            ]
          },
          "735120124": {
            "id": "735120124",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "Ugh... enough! We're not students anymore, so can we just move on from these pointless discussions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120125"
            ]
          },
          "735120125": {
            "id": "735120125",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "You're the one who always starts it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120126"
            ]
          },
          "735120126": {
            "id": "735120126",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "Nonsense! When we were building the first prototype...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120129"
            ]
          },
          "735120129": {
            "id": "735120129",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow... you guys have it out for each other. How could the Akademiya even think of sending you two together to handle this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120130"
            ]
          },
          "735120130": {
            "id": "735120130",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "*sigh* Actually, the Akademiya didn't send us... A person named Kunar was supposed to take care of this matter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120160"
            ]
          },
          "735120160": {
            "id": "735120160",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "You could call him my mentor's mentor... He was there during our thesis defense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120161"
            ]
          },
          "735120161": {
            "id": "735120161",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "I guess that was how he got the impression that \"some young students in the Akademiya had designed a Wenutslayer Cannon,\" or something like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120162"
            ]
          },
          "735120162": {
            "id": "735120162",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "So this time, he simply kicked the two of us back here to deal with the problem, saying that \"the Akademiya needs to give youngsters more opportunities to shine!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120163"
            ]
          },
          "735120163": {
            "id": "735120163",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "But he obviously didn't consider the fact that the two of us have barely talked to each other since graduation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120131"
            ]
          },
          "735120131": {
            "id": "735120131",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "He even convinced my mentor... Ahem, anyway, this is an opportunity for me to get the Wenutslayer Cannon back out in the open!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120132"
            ]
          },
          "735120132": {
            "id": "735120132",
            "speakerId": 30342,
            "speakerName": "Vinayak",
            "text": "Once it's assembled, we'll show those vermin what it can do!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120133"
            ]
          },
          "735120133": {
            "id": "735120133",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "There that mechanical idiot goes again... From my point of view, I also want to investigate the cause of the Wenut rampage to maintain the ecological balance of the desert.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735120134"
            ]
          },
          "735120134": {
            "id": "735120134",
            "speakerId": 30343,
            "speakerName": "Shriya",
            "text": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} Adventurer, you look like someone of impressive skill. May I ask you to keep us safe while we're in the desert?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}